CORPORATE LOAN AGREEMENT

THIS AGREEMENT is made and entered into on January 14, 2021, by and between:

1.1. WYNDHAM FINANCE LIMITED, a private company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales, having its registered office at 123 Oxford Street, London W1D 2JS, England and Wales ("Lender");
1.2. ACME INCORPORATED, a corporation incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware, having its principal place of business at 456 Main Street, Wilmington, DE 19801, USA ("Parent Borrower"); and
1.3. ACME EUROPE LIMITED, a private company incorporated under the laws of Ireland, having its registered office at 789 Dublin Road, Dublin 4, Ireland ("Subsidiary Borrower") (collectively, the "Borrowers").

WHEREAS, the Borrowers desire to borrow funds from the Lender for the purpose of refinancing certain outstanding indebtedness and financing certain capital expenditures; and

WHEREAS, the Lender is willing to lend the Borrowers the requested funds on the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement.

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants and promises contained herein, the parties agree as follows:

SECTION 2. LOAN TERMS

2.1. Loan Amount. The Lender agrees to lend the Borrowers a principal amount of Five Million United States Dollars ($5,000,000.00) (the "Loan Amount").
2.2. Loan Term. The Loan Amount shall be repaid in full on or before January 14, 2024 (the "Maturity Date").
2.3. Drawdown. The Borrowers shall have the right to draw down the Loan Amount in one or more installments, provided that each drawdown shall be in an amount of at least One Million United States Dollars ($1,000,000.00).
2.4. Repayment. The Borrowers shall repay the Loan Amount in accordance with the repayment schedule set forth in Exhibit A attached hereto.

SECTION 3. INTEREST AND FEES

3.1. Interest Rate. The Borrowers shall pay interest on the outstanding principal amount of the Loan Amount at a rate of 4.75% per annum (the "Interest Rate").
3.2. Interest Payments. The Borrowers shall make interest payments on the Loan Amount on a quarterly basis, commencing on April 15, 2021, and continuing on the 15th day of each quarter thereafter.
3.3. Fees. The Borrowers shall pay to the Lender a commitment fee of 0.50% per annum on the Loan Amount, payable quarterly in arrears.

SECTION 4. DEFAULT AND REMEDIES

4.1. Events of Default. The occurrence of any of the following events shall constitute an event of default under this Agreement:
(a) failure to make any payment when due;
(b) failure to perform or observe any covenant or agreement contained in this Agreement; or
(c) the occurrence of any event of bankruptcy or insolvency.
4.2. Remedies. Upon the occurrence of an event of default, the Lender shall have the right, at its option, to exercise any or all of the following remedies:
(a) terminate this Agreement;
(b) declare the entire principal amount of the Loan Amount immediately due and payable; or
(c) take possession of and sell any collateral securing the Loan Amount.

SECTION 5. SIGNATURES

5.1. The parties hereto have executed this Agreement as of the date first above written.

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Agreement as of the date first above written.

